{"completed": true, "response": "{\"better\":\"X\",\"regress\":\"有，X对人物心理变化的原因、前后几段之间的因果承接交代得不如Y清楚，部分感受词也有重复。\",\"nets\":{\"scan\":\"X\",\"point\":\"X\",\"why\":\"Y\",\"whole\":\"Y\",\"fine\":\"X\"},\"why\":\"X的短句和放大加亮的关键词让我边听音乐边扫屏幕时，更容易迅速抓住每段的情绪转折；按音乐进程出现的感受词，也更容易把具体的声音、身体感觉和人物心情联系起来，细腻程度更高。Y的优势是把他为什么靠近、为什么退缩、为什么又愿意坦白解释得更连贯，整首曲子像同一个人的完整经历，而X有时需要观众自己补足这些联系。综合实际观看体验，我选X，但会明显感觉Y在心理因果和整体叙事上更稳。\"}", "metadata": {"session_handle": "b144c88e-2b68-4a40-b13c-f611d42aedec", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T055837942093Z", "elapsed_seconds": 45.672, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T05:59:23.612523+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "ba68fd0e6d16b360bb3a12048595cd84c349aa6158a9d6f008adfcf8203e519a", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d